OL,3,GNEWSATwo passengers die in
OL,4,Asingle-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men who were passengers in a car
OL,7,Fhave died in a crash.
OL,9,FNorthamptonshire Police said the
OL,10,Fsingle-vehicle crash involved a black
OL,11,FMini Clubman on the High Street in
OL,12,FBrackley at about 21:25 BST on Friday.
OL,14,FThe men, aged 19 and 27, were back-seat
OL,15,Fpassengers and died at the scene,
OL,16,Faccording to police.
OL,18,FThe driver and a front-seat passenger
OL,19,Fwere also injured and taken to
OL,20,Fhospital.
